 759:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * Function Name: CyBle_AiossSendNotification
 760:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** ***************************************************************************//**
 761:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * 
 762:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Sends a notification with a characteristic value of the Automation Input Output
 763:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Service, which is a value specified by charIndex, to the client's device.
 764:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *
 765:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  On enabling notification successfully for a service characteristic it sends 
 766:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  out a 'Handle Value Notification' which results in 
 767:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  CYBLE_EVT_AIOSC_NOTIFICATION event at the GATT Client's end.
 768:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * 
 769:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param connHandle:   The connection handle.
 770:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param charIndex:    The index of the service characteristic. Starts with 
