 836:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * 
 837:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Sends an indication with a characteristic value of the Automation Input Output
 838:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Service, which is a value specified by charIndex, to the client's device.
 839:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  
 840:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  On enabling indication successfully it sends out a 'Handle Value Indication' 
 841:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  which results in CYBLE_EVT_AIOSC_INDICATION or 
 842:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  CYBLE_EVT_GATTC_HANDLE_VALUE_IND (if service specific callback function is
 843:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  not registered) event at the GATT Client's end.
 844:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *
 845:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param connHandle:   The connection handle.
 846:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param charIndex:    The index of the service characteristic.
 847:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param charInstance: The instance number of the characteristic specified by 
 848:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *                       "charIndex".
 849:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  \param attrSize:     The size of the characteristic value attribute.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\ARTEM\AppData\Local\Temp\ccuSJ5wi.s 			page 26


