 851:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *                       should be sent to the client's device.
 852:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * 
 853:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * \return
 854:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  A return value is of type CYBLE_API_RESULT_T.
 855:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_OK - The request handled successfully.
 856:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER - Validation of the input parameter failed.
 857:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_INVALID_OPERATION - This operation is not permitted.
 858:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_INVALID_STATE - Connection with the client is not established.
 859:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_MEMORY_ALLOCATION_FAILED - Memory allocation failed.
 860:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_IND_DISABLED - Indication is not enabled by the client.
 861:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   * CYBLE_ERROR_GATT_DB_INVALID_ATTR_HANDLE - An optional characteristic is
 862:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *                                               absent.
 863:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *
 864:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * \events
 865:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  In case of successful execution (return value = CYBLE_ERROR_OK)
 866:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  the next events can appear: \n
 867:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *   If the Aios service-specific callback is registered 
