 972:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Sets the value for Aggregate characteristic. 
 973:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  All of the defined Digital characteristics with the Read property set be
 974:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  part of Aggregate (if available). The length of each of the Digital characteristics 
 975:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  that is part of the Aggregate is determined from the number of signals defined in the 
 976:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Number of Digitals descriptor of the Digital characteristic. The Digital part byte 
 977:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  aligned and trailing bits (if any) set to 0. The order of the Digital characteristics 
 978:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  is determined by the value in the Description field of the Characteristic Presentation 
 979:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  Format descriptor with the lowest value first. 
 980:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  All of the defined Analog characteristics with Read property set part of the Aggregate
 981:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  (if available). The order of the Analog characteristics is determined by the value in 
 982:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  the Description field of the Characteristic Presentation Format descriptor with the 
 983:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  lowest value first. 
 984:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  The first analog input follows directly after the last Digital characteristic.
 985:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * 
 986:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** * \return
 987:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  A return value is of type CYBLE_GATT_ERR_CODE_T.
 988:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  * CYBLE_GATT_ERR_NONE - The advertisement packet collected successfully.
 989:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *  * CYBLE_GATT_ERR_INVALID_HANDLE - 'handleValuePair.attrHandle' is not valid.
 990:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** *
 991:Generated_Source\PSoC4/Bluetooth_aios.c **** ******************************************************************************/
